  // editor (gap row 77 closure, 2026-05-22). `enabledChannels` is the
  // explicit allow-list of booking channels this doctor accepts; an
  // empty array means "all channels permitted" so existing doctors keep
  // working unchanged. `bufferMinutes` is the Doctor-level DEFAULT
  // buffer between slots — distinct from `DoctorSchedule.bufferMinutes`,
  // which can override it per weekday schedule.
  enabledChannels AppointmentChannel[] @default([])
  bufferMinutes   Int                  @default(0)

