// Pearl ERP §2.1.3 — SNOMED CT concept catalogue (parallel to ICD-10).
// Mirrors Icd10Code's shape so the /snomed lookup route can use the
// same AND-of-OR token search. Today seeded with a small starter set
// of common primary-care concepts; intended to be re-seeded from the
